@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Import the sample Trivy report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scans/trivy
Content-Type: application/json

< ../../samples/trivy-sample.json

### List scans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scans

### Latest findings, High and above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/findings?minSeverity=High

### What changed since the previous scan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diff?artifact=vulnlens-demo:latest
